	quest.0051AD1BF14F9EC9.quest_subtitle: "When arnoud neck: &4+10% Summon Damage"
	quest.0051AD1BF14F9EC9.title: "Obtain a &bConjurer's Talisman"
	quest.01219DEB95032DC7.title: "Craft a&b Shadow-Walker Armor Set"
	quest.0177BB2C7A23D8EF.quest_desc: ["The Baker will craft bread dough, cookie dough, cake dough, and raw pumpkin pie, then bake these in a furnace to create bread, cookies, cakes, and pumpkin pies. They will only do this upon request, whether from the Cook, the postbox, or as a minimum stock in the Warehouse."]
	quest.0177BB2C7A23D8EF.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fcooked goods&7 for &fRestaurants&7."
	quest.0177BB2C7A23D8EF.title: "&fBuild a &6Cookery"
	quest.01CD8EBC9F31301D.title: "Jax: Stage 1"
	quest.01E83EF43D3A1646.quest_desc: ["The Graveyard is where the Undertaker will bury your deceased citizens. When a citizen dies, a grave will spawn at the location of death. The Undertaker will attempt to recover the grave before it despawns. If successful, the Undertaker will return to the graveyard and attempt to revive the citizen. If the citizen cannot be revived, the Undertaker will bury them in the Graveyard. Another grave will be placed with the citizen’s name on it."]
	quest.01E83EF43D3A1646.quest_subtitle: "&7Take care of your &fdead&7."
	quest.01E83EF43D3A1646.title: "&fBuild a &6Graveyard"
	quest.0206507E91CB74CB.quest_subtitle: "Use in Smithing Table to remove &4Imbuement or Upgrades"
	quest.0206507E91CB74CB.title: "Craft a &bShriving Stone"
	quest.027C0D2BEA2286B4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gantries&r move contraptions linearly, either horizontally or vertically, and can be chained together for multi-axis movement."
		""
		"&6The Gantry Carriage&r attaches to &eGantry Shafts&r, and when the shaft rotates, it moves the carriage along it."
		""
		"If the Gantry Shaft receives redstone signal it will stop the Gantry Carriage from moving and will relay rotational power to the Gantry Carriage output shaft."
	]
	quest.0317829B7FB5EEC2.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Gearshift&r will reverse the direction of rotation if a redstone signal is applied."]
	quest.03A09B606040AD2E.quest_subtitle: "Rare random drop from Blazes."
	quest.03BAE87F3183DFF5.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith is a 3x3 crafter and can make any vanilla tools, armor, swords, and shields (no bows or redstone items). You will need to teach the Blacksmith the recipes of the items you want them to create. "]
	quest.03BAE87F3183DFF5.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &ftools&7, &farmor&7, and &fweapons&7."
	quest.03BAE87F3183DFF5.title: "&fBuild a &6Blacksmith Hut"
	quest.046E5014796E7042.quest_desc: ["With those fragments you can unlock Eldrith tier spells - those are very powerful."]
	quest.050581D9E93C3DE0.quest_desc: [
		"Many blocks have Filter Slots. Use Filters to sort multiple items. "
		""
		"&n&6List Filters&r&r sort specific items you put into them, while &6&nAttribute Filters&r&r sort items by tags or attributes."
		""
		"&4Tip:&r You can use the JEI search funciton, to look for an item you want and drag it into the Filter slot. This way you can set your filter in advance without having the items itself to filter."
	]
	quest.050581D9E93C3DE0.title: "Filters"
	quest.058C9035FE584EA6.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train schedule&r is helpful as you can decide what order a train goes from station to station and how long it is at the station before it departs for the next station."
		""
		"You can right click a mob on a &ered seat&r that is next to the train controls to set that mob as the train conductor and they will follow the train schedule"
	]
	quest.058C9035FE584EA6.title: "Train Schedule"
	quest.05B141ADED21BBD8.quest_subtitle: "Craft a tinker station"
	quest.05B141ADED21BBD8.title: "Tool crafting"
	quest.063D0C4E3D5DC067.quest_desc: ["he &n&6Chain Drive&r can relay rotation to each other in a row. Any part of the row can be rotated 90 degrees to send rotation upwards or downwards."]
	quest.0641287E9700DE63.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6Vaults&r&r are large containers that can only be accessed by Funnels, Hoppers, and similar devices. "
		""
		"They can be connected and scaled up to a size of 3x3x9, storing up to 103,680 items."
	]
	quest.06D197D1D00E38E1.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fdyes&7 and &fdyes items&7."
	quest.06D197D1D00E38E1.title: "&fBuild a &6Dyer's Hut"
	quest.06DCE1D48E7A8D08.quest_desc: [
		"Give a Conductor a pair of Engineer's Goggles and right-click it with a Remote Lens to be able to remotely control the Conductor like a little robot! "
		""
		"Your actions as a Conductor are limited but you can use Trains and Buttons."
	]
	quest.06DCE1D48E7A8D08.title: "Lens Conductor"
	quest.074604E13C7DC3A2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Andesite Tunnel&r can be a great way to cover your belts. Whenever an Andesite Tunnel has a belt connecting from its side as well, it will split exactly 1 item off from a stack. "
		""
		""
		"You can link multiple tunnels by placing them next to each other."
	]
	quest.074604E13C7DC3A2.title: "Andesite Tunnels"
	quest.07E12DA2B3EC76D1.title: "Craft a &bPyromancer Armor Set"
	quest.07E5E57F49631757.title: "Kill Andreas"
	quest.080B723C85CEBA9D.quest_subtitle: "Butcher animals and sell their drops"
	quest.0834CF5341CCAD7A.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fconcrete&7."
	quest.0834CF5341CCAD7A.title: "&fBuild a &6Concrete Mixer's Hut"
	quest.0899D56FE2572D21.quest_desc: ["Horizontal fluid tanks! Work on trains, work as boilers, and feature multiple window shapes."]
	quest.08C56563442FE079.quest_desc: ["A redstone component that toggles on when recieving a redstone signal on one side and off when recieviing a signal on anoter side."]
	quest.0976D8BCAFC42400.quest_subtitle: "Non-craftable get from shop"
	quest.0AB085CDA15761DD.quest_desc: [
		"Starving colonists will eat just about anything, including raw food and rotten flesh. Yuck! "
		""
		"When citizens are hungry, they will come to the Restaurant and the Cook will give them food. (assuming you have food to give them) Consider building a Fisher’s Hut, or a Cowhand’s Hut. "
		""
		"Note: Make sure to choose a fuel for your cook to use. Some popular options are charcoal, sticks, and planks, although anything with a burn time will work. "
	]
	quest.0AB085CDA15761DD.quest_subtitle: "&7Distributes &ffood&7 to your colonists."
	quest.0AB085CDA15761DD.title: "&fBuild a &6Restaurant"
	quest.0BBC6A4A4F5C1CF7.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0BBC6A4A4F5C1CF7.quest_subtitle: "Farms &ffish&r for your colony."
	quest.0BBC6A4A4F5C1CF7.title: "&fBuild a &6Fisher's Hut"
	quest.0BE2ECFAC7286CCB.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.0BE2ECFAC7286CCB.quest_subtitle: "See the plan come together."
	quest.0BE2ECFAC7286CCB.title: "&fCraft the &6Builder's Goggles"
	quest.0C195F18E1D788F9.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Saw&r&r can harvest trees and can also be used as a Sawmill."
		""
		"Connecting an inventory to it, like a chest with Glue or a Linear Chassis, will store the items directly into the chest when used as a contraption."
		""
		"When used as a Sawmill use the Filter slot to make sure you get the item you want."
		""
		"&o&cTip&r: Using JEI (Just Enough Items) search function, you can drag an item, for example Stripped Wood into the List Filter and then place the List Filter in the Sawmill Filter slot.&r"
	]
	quest.0CAA1F2CB7922740.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Arm&r is a machine that can take items from a Depot or a Belt and place them into a different Depot, Belt, Crafter or into a chest that has a Funnel attached."
		""
		"To select input/output hold the Arm in your hand and R-Click the blocks you want to assign."
		""
		"To deselect a block, L-Click it with the Arm in your hand."
	]
	quest.0CB8AE2CCAF88868.quest_desc: [
		"The Town Hall is the central building in your colony. It provides lots of helpful information about your colony such as citizen stats, open work orders, citizen happiness, allies and more. "
		""
		"The settings tab should be a first stop for any new colonist as it contains options for hiring mode, housing assignment mode, and options to allow kids to be born. Also, this is where you can customize your colony flag. Your flag will appear on guard towers and guard shields. "
	]
	quest.0CB8AE2CCAF88868.quest_subtitle: "Take control of your colony."
	quest.0CB8AE2CCAF88868.title: "&fBuild a &6Town Hall"
	quest.0CED2AC028189316.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone plays a crucial role in Create, making contraptions more compact yet slightly more complex. "
		""
		"Dive in and enjoy exploring the intricacies of redstone engineering with the new blocks and mechanics. "
	]
	quest.0CED2AC028189316.title: "Redstone + Create"
	quest.0CF69DBA9573A7B3.quest_desc: [
		"Use a &6Schematic and Quill&r to save a build as a schematic file. "
		""
		"These files can be used across different worlds, allowing you to build in Creative mode and recreate it in Survival or on a server. "
		""
		"Saved schematics (stored in the 'schematics' folder) can be copied to &eEmpty Schematics&r for deployment and construction by a &3Schematicannon&r."
	]
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
	]
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_subtitle: "Time to design your colony."
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.title: "&fCraft a &6Build Tool"
	quest.0DB9DA1B8C2BF322.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.0DB9DA1B8C2BF322.quest_subtitle: "Find out what your workers need."
	quest.0DB9DA1B8C2BF322.title: "&fCraft a &6Clipboard"
	quest.0DDCE73E115DCE86.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Evocation Spell Power"
	quest.0DDCE73E115DCE86.title: "Craft an &bEvocation Upgrade Orb"
	quest.0E608978AE149A6A.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.0E608978AE149A6A.quest_subtitle: "Return back to the Butcher with the Parts to finish the Quest"
	quest.0E608978AE149A6A.title: "Talk to Butcher Apprentice"
	quest.0E99CC805F88B787.quest_desc: [
		"The &6encased fan&r has many different uses, it can be used to blast, wash, haunt and smoke items. The rotation will mean it either pushes or pulls air"
		""
		"To &cblast&r items you need to put a lava source infront of the fan"
		""
		"To &9wash&r items you need to put a water source infront of the fan"
		""
		"To &bhaunt&r items you need to put a soul campfire infront of the fan"
		""
		"To &esmoke&r items you need to put a campire infront of the fan"
	]
	quest.0EA2E8537E17C0EA.quest_desc: [
		"These &6Blueprints &rcan be given one or more crafting recipes, which they then apply to your held items whenever you right-click them."
		""
		"The quickest and most effective way to assign recipes is to locate the recipe in JEI while the blueprint UI is open. Clicking the '+' in the JEI recipe view will transfer the recipe ingredients to the blueprint for you."
	]
	quest.0EA2E8537E17C0EA.title: "Big Plans"
	quest.0EB4AE4B386636AE.quest_desc: ["Sleeps for long periods in snow biomes where it can cool off. But when it awakes it won't stop till its hunger is fulfilled. Slay the beast while it sleeps."]
	quest.0EB4AE4B386636AE.title: "Sleeping Monster"
	quest.0EC9C78FFD266698.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.0EC9C78FFD266698.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fcattle&r for your colony."
	quest.0EC9C78FFD266698.title: "&fBuild a &6Cowhand's Hut"
	quest.0EFD1ED41729D98B.quest_desc: [
		"Rejected by the book-keeper, you start your journey."
		""
		"As an &l&aoutsider&r&r your main goal is to contribute to society."
		""
		"You can do so by either following the quest line, or pay a hefty fee and bribe the book-keeper. The quest book will be there to guide you either way. Good luck!"
	]
	quest.0EFD1ED41729D98B.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.0EFD1ED41729D98B.title: "The Beginning"
	quest.0F16498769DFB3B0.quest_desc: ["This will be the main ingredient for most of this mod's items and blocks."]
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_subtitle: "&7Kickstart your &fcolony&7 by sea."
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.title: "&fCraft a &6Supply Ship"
	quest.0F875C6440C21D88.quest_desc: ["An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Boots."]
	quest.10D9CA34C3C60DE1.title: "Kill the Huge Man"
	quest.1111D7EB273CFD48.quest_desc: [
		"The Archery is where your Archers in Training will train to become Archer. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs. "
		""
		"The Archers in Training require a bow to practice. They will shoot at the practice targets, a target block"
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school. "
	]
	quest.1111D7EB273CFD48.quest_subtitle: "&7Train your &fguards&7 to become &farchers&7."
	quest.1111D7EB273CFD48.title: "&fBuild an &6Archery"
	quest.11D17F3043BCFC7E.quest_desc: [
		"Using a wooden silo, you can turn rotten flesh or bone meal into fertilizer!"
		""
		"&8&oThis is an optional quest line. You can complete it to earn money! It's not a lot, but it's enough to get you started.&r&r"
	]
	quest.11D17F3043BCFC7E.quest_subtitle: "Good for your plants"
	quest.11D17F3043BCFC7E.title: "Making fertilizer"
	quest.12506A200E56E7E9.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &cblood&r. Increased &cblood spell power&r or &carmor&r."
	quest.12506A200E56E7E9.title: "Craft&b Blood Rune"
	quest.13018D7AC52AF359.quest_desc: ["A redstone component that extends a pulse to a configurable amount."]
	quest.1384694D6D501415.quest_desc: ["Pillaging and burning villages come with consequences and when this corrupted knight finally perished he was sent to hell. But even in hell he could not be stopped and is now residing in a fortress ruling the surrounding nether. Finally put this knight into the ground for good."]
	quest.1384694D6D501415.title: "Knightly Duty"
	quest.139B0F6AB99231C6.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Harvester&r will harvest any crops it goes over. "
		""
		"If it has a connected inventory, the items will be stored in it."
	]
	quest.13C42AC0880B379C.quest_desc: [
		"The &6depot&r serves as a stationary place for items. "
		""
		"It can be used to have an item go into a chest through a Funnel, have a Spout interact with the item on the depot or have a Mechanical Arm take or place an item of the Depot."
	]
	quest.141586825046EA86.quest_desc: [
		"&6&nCasings&r&r can only be crafted through physically applying a valid alloy or ingot to any Stripped variant of Log or Wood. "
		""
		"The logs will convert themselves into the casing, where the player can either mine it with their preferred tool or use a &bWrench &rto place the casing in their inventory."
	]
	quest.14E50EA7F97274A2.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Chute&r is used to insert/extract from inventories, or to place/take items from a belt."
		""
		"You can put a powered Fan under them to transfer them upwards."
	]
	quest.14E50EA7F97274A2.title: "Chute"
	quest.14E9C287665C6AD4.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Blood Spell Power"
	quest.14E9C287665C6AD4.title: "Craft a&b Blood Upgrade Orb"
	quest.14F1FF3CB61083E3.quest_desc: ["You will polish the &drose quartz&r to use in making electron tubes"]
	quest.14F1FF3CB61083E3.quest_subtitle: "Off hand the sand paper and then right click with the &drose quartz&r"
	quest.14F1FF3CB61083E3.title: "&dPolished Rose Quartz&r"
	quest.151ED11B790D388C.quest_desc: ["Using the tool part builder, combine a pattern with some cobblestone and make a stone tool part."]
	quest.151ED11B790D388C.quest_subtitle: "Make a rock pick head"
	quest.151ED11B790D388C.title: "Tool crafting"
	quest.153FB224571B339A.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: &4+15% Cast Time Reduction"
	quest.153FB224571B339A.title: "Obtain a&b Ring of Expediency"
	quest.158473F245B2DE36.quest_desc: ["These worms are old and use the deserts they inhabit as hunting grounds. Slay this beast a put an end to their control over sand power."]
	quest.158473F245B2DE36.title: "Come on just let me ride it"
	quest.1635F236C8B9015D.quest_subtitle: "???"
	quest.175F9319E9507B83.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Debris can be mined near Bedrock level with a Netherite pickaxe or greater. Use it to make Arcane Salvage that can be used to make Empty Upgrade Orbs."
	quest.175F9319E9507B83.title: "Netherwhite"
	quest.17B93C9C6BCF3307.quest_desc: [
		"&lWho you are:&r &4The ultimate ruler of the Arkain&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r Wield the highest authority, don a unique set of armor, and create or upgrade a &6MineColony&f with special requests."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lChallenge the throne:&r The &dHigh King&f's rule can be challenged by a &6King &f(or a faction) through a &o&4coup d'état&r&f. "
		""
		"The challenger must gather support, claim more land, and defeat the &dHigh King&f to take the throne."
	]
	quest.17B93C9C6BCF3307.title: "&dHigh King"
	quest.17C649AD8C23444B.quest_subtitle: "Useful for spell resistance. "
	quest.17C649AD8C23444B.title: "Craft a &bProtective Rune"
	quest.17E954ED0FFEB78D.quest_desc: ["&4Make sure to breed the pigs you will need more than 2!&r"]
	quest.17E954ED0FFEB78D.quest_subtitle: "Craft a hanging rope"
	quest.17E954ED0FFEB78D.title: "Preparing for butchery"
	quest.17F840E5ABDF3FD4.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Alchemist Cauldron&r is a versatile tool used for various magical tasks. Here are its main functions:"
		""
		"&nBrewing Potions:&r Use it to brew a variety of potions."
		""
		"&nCrafting Elixirs&r: Create powerful elixirs with special ingredients."
		""
		"&nRecycling Scrolls:&r Place scrolls in the cauldron to recycle them into Inks of equivalent rarity."
		""
		"There's a 50% chance to extract the Ink and a 50% chance to burn the Scroll."
		""
		"&nUpgrading Ink:&r Improve the quality of your Ink."
		""
		"&nMaking Blood Vials:&r Craft Blood Vials for different purposes."
		""
		"&6Special Note:&r You can also use crushing wheels from Create on any scroll to get 100% common ink and a small chance of obtaining uncommon ink."
		""
		"&2Important:&r Keep a Campfire below the cauldron to keep it heated."
	]
	quest.17F840E5ABDF3FD4.title: "The Alchemist Cauldron"
	quest.183E008EE8C32DEC.quest_desc: ["I can finally top playing in the dirt (as much) and hand off my farming duties to someone else. I should probably have the farmer start with carrots since they don't need to be cooked, too..."]
	quest.183E008EE8C32DEC.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fcrops&r for your colony."
	quest.183E008EE8C32DEC.title: "&fBuild a &6Farm"
	quest.18690E17CDF023D8.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a Train Track with a Train Signal while facing the direction Trains are intended to go, then place the signal within 15 blocks of the selected Track. "
		""
		"An arrow will appear on the selected Track indicating which way Trains can pass it."
		""
		"&6&l-->&r&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&nTwo-way Tracks&r"
		""
		"Conductors will never cross a Train Signal from the opposite direction. "
		""
		"Unlike other Railway Equipment, multiple Train Signals can select one track. "
		""
		"A Train Signal can be made two-way by having two opposite facing Train Signals linked to the same place. "
		""
		"Train Signals facing the same way on the same Track will be synchronized."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&nTrack Segments&r"
		""
		"Train Signals divide the track network into segments."
		""
		" The segments can be viewed by holding a Signal while looking at the Track. "
		""
		"Conductors will not enter a track segment occupied by another Train, regardless of how large the Train or the segment is."
		""
		"In order to divide a Track into sections, each section must be separated either by a Train Signal or a lack of connected Tracks."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"A circular loop of Tracks requires two Train Signals to divide it, otherwise the Train Signals will have no effect. "
		""
		"A straight track only needs one Train Signal to divide it into two. If a section was successfully defined, the line ahead of the Signal should become a different color. The color has no significance aside from serving to differentiate segments."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&nChain Signal&r"
		""
		"Use a Wrench on the signal to activate chain mode. "
		""
		"This mode will stop the train before the denoted segment if the segment ahead that the train is attempting to path to is occupied. Chain mode is useful at junction locations, where a train could potentially sit in the middle of a junction while waiting for the proceeding segment to become free."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&nDisplay&r"
		""
		"Nixie Tubes can be attached to make the signal more visible, as well as convey additional information."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&nRedstone"
		"&r"
		"Signals give a Redstone Comparator signal while red. Signals can also be forced red by being activated with Redstone."
	]
	quest.18690E17CDF023D8.quest_subtitle: "Train Signals are used to control the flow of Trains not driven by players."
	quest.18B9B5C8B55872F5.quest_subtitle: "Cut wheat dough on a cutting board"
	quest.18B9B5C8B55872F5.title: "Making pasta"
	quest.1997E3F261152BC2.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Water Wheel&r is one of the most basic ways of generating rotational force. You can hook up multiple wheels by placing them next to each other."
		""
		"You can also swich the look of your water wheel by right-clicking it with pretty much any wood plank (including ones from other mods)."
	]
	quest.1A6C36E59385A2D3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steam Engines&r are the best generators in the Create mod, capable of producing thousands of SU with ease. They need heat (e.g., from Fire or Blaze Burners) and a constant flow of water to create steam and generate rotational force. The higher the heat, the more efficient the engine."
		""
		""
		"&nHow to Use:&r"
		""
		"&6Setup:&r Place a Steam Engine on the side of a Fluid Tank filled with water being pumped into the tank."
		""
		"&6Heat Source:&r Ensure there is a heat source below the tank. The higher the heat, the faster the engine will move."
		""
		"&6Optimal Heat Source:&r Use Blaze Burners fed with Blaze Cakes to superheat the water for the highest output."
		""
		"&6Capacity:&r You can attach up to 8 Steam Engines to a single tank for maximum efficiency."
	]
	quest.1A6C36E59385A2D3.title: "Steam Engines"
	quest.1AC0396518806B66.quest_subtitle: "The base for all other &4upgrade orbs&r to be crafted from"
	quest.1AE7A48382D21E32.quest_desc: ["The Bookeeper wants nothing to do with me. Looks like I was buried without a single coin to my name. Not to mention I don't think my currency would even have worked here. Maybe one of these people here in the &6castle library&r can help me?"]
	quest.1AE7A48382D21E32.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.1AE7A48382D21E32.title: "Money Talks"
	quest.1BBEBBEF28E330ED.quest_subtitle: "Non-craftable get from shop"
	quest.1C267CC53FD04C88.title: "Craft a &bCultist Armor Set"
	quest.1C36CBFCA193FE7C.quest_desc: [
		"Place the &2Sticker&r on a Contraption facing towards what it should stick to. "
		""
		"When the contraption stops and the &2Sticker&r is toggled with a &credstone&r signal, the affected block will move along with the contraption."
	]
	quest.1C36CBFCA193FE7C.quest_subtitle: "Used to stick and unstick things to moving Contraptions."
	quest.1C391F19D41777F9.quest_desc: ["Please follow &6Chapter III: The Precision Machine&r to learn how to craft the precision mechanism."]
	quest.1C60254EAE960673.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1C60254EAE960673.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &blightning&r. Increased &blightning spell power&r or &barmor&r."
	quest.1C60254EAE960673.title: "Craft a&b Lightning Rune"
	quest.1CBDE7EDBC42B8E4.quest_desc: ["&n&l&cTrains need fuel to run!&r&r&r Use &4Lava&r in a&d Fuel Tank&r or &0Coal&r inside a Chest to be consumed to power the train."]
	quest.1CBDE7EDBC42B8E4.title: "Fuel"
	quest.1CBE2976A1FBF35D.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6The Deployer&r&r is essential for automation, used in multi-step crafts like mechanisms. "
		""
		"It automates various tasks such as crafting Casings, Polishing, Waxing, and Sequenced Assemblies. Deployers can right- or left-click blocks or entities, allowing them to shear sheep, milk cow, place blocks and more!"
	]
	quest.1CC5CCEC80EEDBA1.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Extendo Grip&r increases your reach distance, thus allowing you to place and break blocks at a larger distance."
		""
		"To use the Extendo Grip, put it in your Off-Hand, and then use blocks or tools in your Main-Hand as you normally would."
		""
		"While wearing a Copper Tank, the Extendo Grip loses no Durability and instead uses some of the air pressure you have stored in your tank."
	]
	quest.1CC5CCEC80EEDBA1.title: "Go Go Gadget"
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: ["Clear out and flatten an area roughly 20x20 blocks to make room for your camp. The camp will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply camp on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the camp in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines may appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_subtitle: "&7Kickstart your &fcolony&7 by land."
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.title: "&fCraft a &6Supply Camp"
	quest.1EC3CBA632BBFCE2.quest_desc: ["Time to make some pasta!"]
	quest.1EC3CBA632BBFCE2.quest_subtitle: "This will sell!"
	quest.1F58AA51814C7568.quest_desc: ["&n&6Super Glue&r can be used to attach blocks to each other to move them with pistons or other means."]
	quest.203CEDAC6E1CAB91.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: &4+100 Max Mana"
	quest.203CEDAC6E1CAB91.title: "Obtain a &bRing of Mana"
	quest.20692FCE89969E9F.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Cart Assemble on rails. Anything you build on top of it will be picked up by a Minecart if the Assembler has a redstone signal, turning the assembled build into a contraption."
		""
		"The blocks must be glued together to be considered a contraption and any blocks requiring rotational force will automatically work."
		""
		"Use a Wrench to right click on the contraption after assembled to take it with you."
		""
		"To \"unmount\" the contraption, place it back at the Cart Assembler and turn off the redstone signal."
	]
	quest.20EAD0D76E8C2683.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+50 Max Mana"
	quest.20EAD0D76E8C2683.title: "Craft a &bMana Upgrade Orb"
	quest.20FE94FD076BC58C.quest_subtitle: "Vertical Vaults"
	quest.210AEB6F1963FA47.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elevator Pulleys&r are like Rope Pulleys but are a bit more suited to Elevators. "
		""
		"They can be controlled remotely more easily and can have floors programmed in them with Redstone Contacts."
	]
	quest.216E2ED7D793F72A.quest_subtitle: "Rare random drop from Evokers or Archevokers."
	quest.2171E790D502004C.quest_subtitle: "&7Improve your childrens &fintelligence&7."
	quest.2171E790D502004C.title: "&fBuild a &6School"
	quest.2179937C0C990863.quest_subtitle: "Grow and eat a tomato"
	quest.2179937C0C990863.title: "Tomato tomato"
	quest.22CFEDFBA6000B0B.quest_desc: ["Click checkbox to set waypoint"]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. If you want to get an idea of the styles before you build, go to youtube and search \"&eMineColonies Build Styles&r\". Note: This pack includes a number of additional styles not shown in the video."]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_subtitle: "It's a big decision."
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.title: "&fChoose a &6Colony Style"
	quest.23A9617F183C4EB1.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Large Cogwheel&r&r transfers rotational power and can change the speed of rotation. "
		""
		"Using it with a small cogwheel can either double the speed (and stress) or halve it, depending on the configuration."
	]
	quest.23CFA6479265D915.quest_desc: [
		"......there was a battle and I...died? But now I'm here. An old man saying he is the &aGraveKeeper&r of this Graveyard. He  gave me this book to journal my travels and take notes. He told me of a city just across the river to the north. How long has it been? I don't reconize anything here. Maybe I can tal to someone to give me some answers?"
		""
		"I was told to look for a city called \"King's Landing\". Someone has been leaving lanterns and campfires, maybe I should follow them."
	]
	quest.23CFA6479265D915.quest_subtitle: "This Journal Writes Itself"
	quest.23CFA6479265D915.title: "How Your Story Begins"
	quest.23ED40EF86DD56B9.quest_desc: [
		"A redstone component that outputs a signal when in contact with another redstone contact."
		""
		"Perticularly useful for building contraptions."
	]
	quest.24912ED9E4920E5A.quest_desc: [
		"&7When right-clicked:&r"
		"Opens the &6Interface.&r &7Sneak-Click&r to place it on a surface."
		""
		"&7When used on Blocks:&r"
		"Some blocks' &6settings,&r such as filters, can be &bcopied (right-click)&r and &6applied (left-click)&r elsewhere."
	]
	quest.24912ED9E4920E5A.quest_subtitle: "Keep track of what you want to do"
	quest.24F8BCB6A24AD091.quest_desc: [
		"To get the &n&6Blaze Burner&r, you need to make an Empty Blaze Burner and R-Click it on a Blaze."
		""
		"This is used under a Basin to heat it or super-heat it for different recipes."
	]
	quest.2501D4F174A999E1.quest_desc: [
		"The Flower Shop is where your Florist will grow flowers for your colony, if given compost and an axe. "
		""
		"One important factor to know is that the flower shop has a daily flower limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 4, level 2 has 8. At level 5 it’s daily max is 20. "
	]
	quest.2501D4F174A999E1.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fflowers&r for your colony."
	quest.2501D4F174A999E1.title: "&fBuild a &6Flower Shop"
	quest.2565C7F7480DFF5C.quest_desc: [
		"The Library is a way for you to raise your adult citizens’ Intelligence skill, which influences skill increases once employed. A citizen will randomly level up their Intelligence as long as they’re assigned to the Library. Paper and books help Library Students increase their skills faster."
		""
		"Being a Library Student is a full-time job, and a student cannot be employed simultaneously at any other hut."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will start school automatically."
	]
	quest.2565C7F7480DFF5C.quest_subtitle: "&7Improve your collective &fintelligence&7."
	quest.2565C7F7480DFF5C.title: "&fBuild a &6Library"
	quest.25C0A807C856BF8A.quest_desc: [
		"Especially useful while building new contraptions, the&6 Toolbox&r keeps your pockets free of clutter. Simply take the toolbox from your workshop and bring it with you. "
		""
		"Toolboxes can store up to 256 of 8 different items and can be accessed remotely when placed nearby."
	]
	quest.25C0FA83D8BDC17C.quest_desc: [
		"The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."
		""
		"Tip: Be sure to give your carpenter a &ebuild tool&r as some recipes require it. "
	]
	quest.25C0FA83D8BDC17C.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fwooden&7 items."
	quest.25C0FA83D8BDC17C.title: "&fBuild a &6Sawmill"
	quest.25F8D49B732EF7C7.quest_subtitle: "Once crafted, it finds the&2 nearest Catacombs&r and &3leads you towards it&r. The trapped soul points toward its home"
	quest.25F8D49B732EF7C7.title: "Craft a &bWayward Compass"
	quest.26FB758B3706B935.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: Slain creatures drop &4+25% experience."
	quest.26FB758B3706B935.title: "Obtain an &bEmerald Stoneplate Ring"
	quest.2749A7BA16C50828.quest_desc: [
		"Place the track and right-click it with a station block. Place the station block near the track."
		""
		""
		"Right click on the station and select \"Create Train\" to enter assembly mode (blue flag shown on station)."
		""
		"Place one or more Train Casings on the track where indicated with blue. The casings will turn into bogeys (wheeled undercarriages.)"
		""
		"When assembled, each bogey will automatically become coupled together as part of the train. To create a carriage, build a platform around two bogeys' bases."
		""
		"Place a Train Controls block facing the direction dictated by the station. This is shown as an arrow on the Station's selected track. Place another set of Train Controls facing the opposite way to make the engine bi-directional (able to travel in both directions) and place a Seat or Blaze Burner behind the controls for the driver."
		""
		"Use Block Attachment Utilities such as Super Glue to connect all parts together (green highlight)."
		""
		"When finished, use the Station's interface to attempt to assemble the Train."
		""
		"If a Train fails to assemble, an error will be shown in the Station's interface. Common errors are detailed below."
		""
		"When assembled, the Train can be named in the Station's interface."
	]
	quest.2749A7BA16C50828.title: "All Aboard!"
	quest.276AFF6A055FA969.quest_desc: ["&6Seats! &rYou can sit on them, and so can mobs if you use a Lead on them and right-click on the seat."]
	quest.276AFF6A055FA969.title: "Take A Seat"
	quest.2779F20FE34D05CE.quest_desc: [
		"\"The halls of power open before me. I have risen from the ranks of knighthood, entrusted with authority by those above, or granted the faith of my peers through their written bonds. Once given, such trust cannot be reclaimed. I am now a Baron, seated among the councils of Arkain. My words carry weight, my decisions shape lands. Politics entwine me, and I must wield this influence with care — for it is both weapon and burden."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r Enforce rules among your &eKnights&f, make judgments, and access magic mods."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lHow to rank up:&r Become a &3Count &fby paying a buy-in fee."
	]
	quest.2779F20FE34D05CE.title: "&cBaron"
	quest.278EF84B1A314870.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.278EF84B1A314870.quest_subtitle: "Keep your colony safe."
	quest.278EF84B1A314870.title: "&fBuild a &6Guard Tower&f and &6Hire a Guard"
	quest.27EE348B6DDCCD0D.quest_desc: [
		"Train Stations are used to create, disassemble, and guide Trains."
		""
		"&oRight-click&r a Train Track, then place the Station within &o15&r blocks of the track. "
		""
		"Stations can be placed on any Track so long as it isn't occupied by a Train Signal or Train Observer, &ohowever&r it can only create Trains if placed on a straight Track, and Bogeys may only be placed on a &o3&r long straight track."
	]
	quest.29917E6196649F5D.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Speedometer&r&r shows you the current speed of the attached components. "
		""
		"You can use a Redstone Comparator next to the Speedometer to send Redstone signal relative to the Speedometer measurements. "
	]
	quest.2A43D53F3C3FA699.quest_desc: ["Generates twice as much SU as the regular water wheel but at a slower RPM. Just know that this thing is bigger and bulkier so have a lot of space for it."]
	quest.2A8D29FA07E42FE7.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6mechanical press&r&r is used for a lot of different things, like making sheets or some recipes using a basin."
		""
		"The &6depot&r is used to hold items on one block"
	]
	quest.2AFC93D91EE19439.quest_desc: ["Allows you to walk underwater like you do on land as well as walk on belts without them moving you, if you think about it, must be really slippery."]
	quest.2B8332B5B8BAF781.quest_desc: [
		"The Swineherd’s Hut is where the Swineherd will breed and butcher pigs for food. You will have to capture and bring in two pigs to the Swineherd’s Hut, as the Swineherd will not catch and bring in any pigs."
		""
		"The Swineherd will only keep two pigs alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten pigs in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.2B8332B5B8BAF781.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fpigs&r for your colony."
	quest.2B8332B5B8BAF781.title: "&fBuild a &6Swineherd's Hut"
	quest.2BF7F2C49CF9F9CA.quest_desc: ["The Smeltery is where the Smelter will smelt ores into ingots. The higher the level of the Smeltery, the more furnaces the Smelter will be able to use. A higher level will also have a higher chance to double and even triple the ingot output per block of ore."]
	quest.2BF7F2C49CF9F9CA.quest_subtitle: "&7Smelts &fores&7 into &fingots&7."
	quest.2BF7F2C49CF9F9CA.title: "&fBuild a &6Smelter"
	quest.2C0E9B0A0453CF9A.quest_desc: [
		"&6&nDisplay Links&r&r let you update text on text displays automatically."
		""
		"Right-click the target text display (Signs, Display Boards), then attach it to the block to read from."
		""
		"It can also interact with Nixie Tubes to display time if attached to a Cuckoo Clock."
	]
	quest.2C4654324D2A3967.quest_desc: ["[You can imbue it with another spell]"]
	quest.2C4654324D2A3967.quest_subtitle: "Seems to be empty?"
	quest.2C777980DFC00673.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Portable Interface&r works in pairs. You need to have one placed in the world and another one on a moving entity, like a Minecart."
		""
		"When the two interfaces are facing each other, they will link and transfer liquids between each other."
	]
	quest.2C9EFE552C3C506C.quest_desc: ["Have connections on the server? Friends willing to invest some money into you? A fee of &65000&r and you're off to the next stage. Simple as that."]
	quest.2C9EFE552C3C506C.quest_subtitle: "Bribe the Book-keeper"
	quest.2E4D0196673FCE5A.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &aevocation&r. Increased &aevocation magic spell power&r or &aarmor&r."
	quest.2E4D0196673FCE5A.title: "Craft an &bEvocation Rune"
	quest.2EE457AAF3EF5BAF.quest_desc: [
		"Phantom Train Tracks are like normal Tracks, but they're invisible! "
		""
		"Useful for 'flying' Trains! Hold the item to see ones you've already placed."
	]
	quest.2EE457AAF3EF5BAF.title: "It's Like Magic, Magic Trains"
	quest.2FD2B1E101481B4A.quest_desc: ["Used to visualise and control which direction trains go in intersections."]
	quest.30378E9E82826E3A.quest_subtitle: "Need more mana? This is needed for that upgrade."
	quest.30378E9E82826E3A.title: "Craft an &bArcane Rune"
	quest.30446DF8DD9884FC.quest_desc: ["These ancient bones have been here since the beginning of this place. Maybe these were the first warborn creatures to be snatched and placed here? Cursed to never die even with all its flesh gone this creature has surely beaten all and will fight to keep its winning streak in its temple in the desert."]
	quest.30446DF8DD9884FC.title: "Jurrasic End"
	quest.30991CD8227E7952.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.30991CD8227E7952.quest_subtitle: "&7Mines &fores&7 and &fmaterials&7 from the Nether."
	quest.30991CD8227E7952.title: "&fBuild a &6Nether Mine"
	quest.313B26E365615526.title: "Craft a&b Cryomancer Armor Set"
	quest.31765D0D7F5E89E0.quest_desc: [
		"A block that can be used to detect a variety of events such as detecting items and fluid inside a container, passing through belts, chutes and pipes."
		""
		"You can use the filter slot to only detect a specific item/items or fluid inside a container or any of the other variables. Or you can also place the block matching the filter in front of the Smart Observer. "
		""
		"When it detects something it sends a redstone signal. If you place it next to a Funnel, it will send a redstone signal when an item exits or enters the Funnel."
	]
	quest.31C539FC15F26208.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Hand Crank&r&r is the simplest way to generate kinetic energy, by using yourself as the power source. Get that arm strength!"]
	quest.31C539FC15F26208.title: "Crank it all the way!"
	quest.32C2E8EE2ABC4A97.quest_desc: ["Craft a flint knife and a cutting board. It's time to start cooking!"]
	quest.32C2E8EE2ABC4A97.quest_subtitle: "Be careful with that"
	quest.32C2E8EE2ABC4A97.title: "First steps into culinary"
	quest.3355FF385357F299.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fvarious items&7."
	quest.3355FF385357F299.title: "&fBuild a &6Mechanic's Hut"
	quest.34AF9F62C1D9F9EE.quest_desc: [
		"he &n&6Adjustable Chain Drive&r works similar to the normal Chain Drive when it has no redstone signal."
		""
		"When you apply a redstone signal and it is the block receiving the rotational force, it will double the speed for the connected Chain Drives."
		""
		"When it isn’t the block receiving the rotational force and you apply a redstone signal, it will halfen the speed for the Adjustable Chain Gearshift only. "
	]
	quest.3544B503C8E588C2.quest_desc: ["These factories in the nether help produce weapons for the local lords. Destroy its protector and shut down these factories of mass destruction."]
	quest.3544B503C8E588C2.title: "Machines Keep Turning"
	quest.357E9B952643A99D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane essence&r is the most common and most important magical material."
		""
		"It can be found in magical structures, looted from magical enemies, or produced automatically with Create."
		""
		"Small amounts of arcane essence can be used to craft weak magic items, but its primary purpose is to be condensed into &6Arcane Cloth&r or &6Arcane Ingots&r for use in more powerful crafting recipes."
	]
	quest.35CB3E93AD19F975.quest_desc: ["&n&6Empty Blaze Burners&r&r can be used to capture &cBlazes&r to make &4Blaze Burners&r, or can be lit with a Flint and Steel to make a brazier!"]
	quest.36A349901932BED2.quest_desc: ["This will run the citizenship rank commands"]
	quest.36A349901932BED2.title: "Citizen Rank Commands"
	quest.3714D5CA2A2A69EC.title: "Craft a&b Priest Armor Set"
	quest.372818524C1822A0.quest_desc: ["&6Windmills&r are great power generators. Place a Radial Chassis in front of the Bearing, attach it to at least 8 Wool Blocks (or Sails), and right-click the Bearing to assemble the Contraption and start the windmill!"]
	quest.372818524C1822A0.title: "Don't get blown away"
	quest.376FC7B08FCF4E4D.quest_desc: [
		"This Feline just gave me the opportunity to earn some coin. "
		"I'll see where I can find the Butcher. "
		"He hinted the Butcher has a &6Shop &rcould be &6near the Fountain &r"
	]
	quest.376FC7B08FCF4E4D.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.376FC7B08FCF4E4D.title: "A Meaty Hand"
	quest.377D64FABCA6D4C0.quest_desc: [
		"On a Train, &l&6Train Controls&r&r can be right clicked to take control of the Train. The player's ordinary movement options will affect the Train instead. "
		""
		"Use the controls again or sneak to stop. Hold &oleft or right&r at a fork to choose a path. Use the &oscroll wheel&r to adjust maximum speed. Hold &ojump&r to approach and align at a Station. "
		""
		"If a Steam Whistle is attached, press the sprint key to blow it."
	]
	quest.379AA16F6178C1E8.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.37BAA0D081738453.quest_subtitle: "Welcome Travler"
	quest.38152ABECF34B660.title: "Start of Knight"
	quest.382935FC862D19F8.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.382935FC862D19F8.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fsheep&r for your colony."
	quest.382935FC862D19F8.title: "&fBuild a &6Shepherd's Hut"
	quest.391E94F1938AC865.quest_subtitle: "When around neck: &4+15% Spell Resistance"
	quest.391E94F1938AC865.title: "Obtain a &bHeavy Chain"
	quest.3A4B911F19D525DB.quest_desc: ["Unlock more Features by having a Linked account."]
	quest.3A4B911F19D525DB.quest_subtitle: "Link your Account on the Community Website. Just execute the command /link"
	quest.3A4B911F19D525DB.title: "Link your Account"
	quest.3A5FC3F7482E70A5.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &farrows&7."
	quest.3A5FC3F7482E70A5.title: "&fBuild a &6Fletcher's Hut"
	quest.3AE96B65B211C2EF.quest_desc: ["The &6hose pulley&r has the ability to pull liquids from the world to be transported, if the source the pulley is pulling from is larger than 10,000 blocks then it classes it as an infinite source of liquid"]
	quest.3B39F6C1C39D1249.quest_desc: [
		"\"Steel upon my shoulders, honor upon my name. Through trial and deed, I have proven myself worthy of the title. Whether by the hand of noble recognition or through the bonds of sworn loyalty, I have been raised to knighthood. As a Knight, I stand as protector and servant of Arkain, my blade sanctioned, my oath binding. The world now sees me not as a wanderer, but as one sworn to duty and valor.\""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r Claim land, fight for your &cBaron&f, and utilize &6MineColonies &f(the server’s claim system)."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"How to rank up: A &3Count &fcan promote you to &cBaron&f."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lSpecial note:&r &eKnights &fhave the right to rebel against their &cBaron&f, becoming a &9Rogue Knight&f."
	]
	quest.3B39F6C1C39D1249.title: "&eKnight"
	quest.3B45E446F31C49F2.quest_desc: [
		"Before anything can be built, you need a Builder. The Builder must build their own Builder’s Hut before building any other huts, and they cannot build or upgrade a hut to a higher level than their own hut level. "
		""
		"The builder is arguably the hardest working citizen in your colony. (Second only to you). You are not limited to just one builder. As your colony grows, you may need to add more builders just to keep up. "
	]
	quest.3B45E446F31C49F2.quest_subtitle: "Constructs buildings."
	quest.3B45E446F31C49F2.title: "&fBuild a &6Builder's Hut"
	quest.3BC9D3B6BAF2C477.quest_desc: ["The &6item drain&r has the ability to take liquid out of a container and then it stores it until it it is piped out into a container"]
	quest.3BC9D3B6BAF2C477.quest_subtitle: "Fluid extraction"
	quest.3BE37336A82576BA.quest_desc: ["No one knows where Maledictus came from. Was he truly an angel of the gods and fell from their grace? Or is he another taken from his home and placed in this world. No matter the reason he will kill all who challenges him with no remorse in his keep in the overworld."]
	quest.3BE37336A82576BA.title: "Fallen Angel of Death"
	quest.3C1863DCB01DF56C.quest_desc: ["Cooking tomatoes in the cooking pot will give you tomato sauce, a key ingredient of the famous pasta."]
	quest.3C1863DCB01DF56C.quest_subtitle: "Don't ask me for the sauce"
	quest.3C4C4AAB5C69654A.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Plough&r will destroy any non-solid block, turn dirt into farmland and launch entities without doing damage. "
		""
		"If it has a connected inventory, the items will be stored in it."
	]
	quest.3C66D245B49E3277.quest_desc: [
		"What a weird fellow that cataloguer. Whatever his interests he directed me to go to the castle to talk with the &aBookeeper&r"
		""
		"You can return to King's Landing anytime with the command /warp"
	]
	quest.3C66D245B49E3277.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.3C66D245B49E3277.title: "City of Hope"
	quest.3C6FD14B4798B294.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Mechanical Crafters&r can be connected to each other to form a huge in-world crafting table."
		""
		"The arrows on the Mechanical Crafters must eventually converge on the same Mechanical Crafter slot to finish the recipe. You can turn the arrows by R-Clicking it with the Wrench."
		""
		"If there is a recepe that uses less slots than the ones you have, you can use a Cafter Slot Cover to avoid items going into them."
		""
		"Tip:If you make the arrow on the last slot go into a chest, the item will automatically be store in it"
	]
	quest.3C6FD14B4798B294.title: "&lMechanical Crafter"
	quest.3CA8E3CDE5F8DAF7.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6Redstone Links&r&r let you transmit Redstone signals wirelessly. "
		""
		"They can be tuned to different 'Item Frequencies', and can be shift-right-clicked to toggle Recieving modes. "
	]
	quest.3D0CCD96331F994E.quest_desc: [
		"You can attach &6Belts&r to&b Shafts&r to connect them. They can be used to transfer items horizontally or diagonally with ease. "
		""
		"You can also dye them by right-clicking with a dye on the belts."
		""
		"The belts can be used to also transfer rotational power be it vertically,horizontally or diagonally. "
		""
		"They can even transfer rotation power to shafts in a vertical position with the belt in the horizontal position."
	]
	quest.3D0F9F9B2B945E7A.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.3D0F9F9B2B945E7A.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &bfrost&r. Increased &bfrost spell power&r or &barmor&r."
	quest.3D0F9F9B2B945E7A.title: "Craft an &bIce Rune"
	quest.3E2EAC69D786C49C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.3E2EAC69D786C49C.quest_subtitle: "Craft a pattern"
	quest.3E2EAC69D786C49C.title: "A taste of tinkering"
	quest.3E5E0C768038CDF4.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Cogwheel&r&r transfers rotational power and can also double or halve the speed. "
		""
		"Doubling the speed will also double the stress in the system."
	]
	quest.3E6E9C53FBE836FB.quest_desc: [
		"The Scroll Forge is a new crafting station that allows the player to craft scrolls by using ink, paper, and a focus. "
		""
		"The ink determines the rarity/level, and the focus determines what school of spells you can craft."
		""
		"Scrolls can be automated using the Create mod. You can also use &6Crushing Wheels&r to process any scroll to get some &ncommon ink back&r, with a 10% chance of getting uncommon ink."
	]
	quest.3E6E9C53FBE836FB.quest_subtitle: "Making Spells"
	quest.3E837E5555C6B29F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper Valve&r Handles manually control the flow of fluids through pipes. "
		""
		"Rotate the handle to open or close the valve, allowing or stopping fluid movement."
	]
	quest.3F663416E824720C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.3F691828CC609297.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Basin&r is used for recipes, mainly including the &3Mechanical Press&r and the &3Mechanical Mixer&r."]
	quest.3FD9751C5D4C35A2.quest_desc: ["Ender Guardians are advance warriors of the end dragon. Created with spite and hatred these unfeeling monsters will fulfill their masters will. They will invade the overworld from time to time to wreck havoc."]
	quest.3FD9751C5D4C35A2.title: "The end here?"
	quest.402A9561ACFC2198.quest_desc: [
		"&6Display Boards&r are like scaleable aesthetic Signs. "
		""
		"Right-click them with a Nametag to set their text, or use Display Links to update it automatically."
	]
	quest.402A9561ACFC2198.title: "Display Board"
	quest.4070652999DD3249.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Nature Spell Power"
	quest.4070652999DD3249.title: "Craft a&b Nature Upgrade Orb"
	quest.422A888D3F7C4665.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Fire Spell Power"
	quest.422A888D3F7C4665.title: "Craft a&b Fire Upgrade Orb"
	quest.439F2B2537914CC9.quest_desc: ["&n&6Linked Controllers&r&r allow handheld wireless control over six different Redstone Links."]
	quest.43B06E3FFE5FE8EB.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.43B06E3FFE5FE8EB.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of the &8shadows&r. Increased &8shadow magic spell power&r or &8armor&r."
	quest.43B06E3FFE5FE8EB.title: "Craft an &bEnder Rune"
	quest.449F04B9D2D2482B.quest_desc: [
		"A block that can be used to monitor the fill level of inventories and tanks. "
		""
		"You can set a threshold to send redstone signal when the inventory/tank reaches a certain point be it low or high."
	]
	quest.44A230D1F2ACC5B6.title: "Attackers"
	quest.44B16905ABBF3A52.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: Grants &cfire immunity."
	quest.44B16905ABBF3A52.title: "Obtain a &bFireward Ring"
	quest.4520200F09E91081.quest_desc: [
		"&lWho you are:&r "
		"\"The ink flows as I recall the moment my name was written into the records of Arkain. I am now a citizen, granted the right to labor and to learn. A profession has been chosen — Blacksmith, Inventor, Freeholder, or Arcanist. This craft is more than survival; it is the key to awakening the strength buried within me. I am no longer faceless. I am an Artisan, and my hands shape my destiny.\""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r "
		"Gain access to creation mods like Tinkers' Construct to craft gear and start your adventure."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lHow to rank up:&r "
		"A &cBaron &f(a higher-ranked player) can knight you."
	]
	quest.4520200F09E91081.title: "Artisan"
	quest.4527408738C2E90B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Drills&r mine blocks in front of them when supplied with Rotational Power or when mounted on a moving Contraption, Minecart, or Train. "
		""
		"They will break any block in front of them and store the items in a connected inventory."
	]
	quest.458C172E47DDFA56.quest_subtitle: "&7Sifts for &fextra materials&7."
	quest.458C172E47DDFA56.title: "&fBuild a &6Sifter"
	quest.45E04EA612546D02.quest_desc: [
		"The &6contraption control&r is used as the interface of the elevator for the player to look at and scroll up or "
		"down on the mouse to select the level"
	]
	quest.45E04EA612546D02.quest_subtitle: "Part of the elevator"
	quest.462AAE97EEC191DA.title: "Colllect Tax from Spawn"
	quest.47919CE42B9D2E93.quest_desc: ["This creature hunts in the deepest parts of the ocean. Don't ask me where I won't even touch the ocean knowing this thing is in it."]
	quest.47919CE42B9D2E93.title: "Thank god the world is not an ocean"
	quest.47A4B3F0E1EDBEFB.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.47A4B3F0E1EDBEFB.quest_subtitle: "&7Mine for &fores&7 and &fmaterials&7."
	quest.47A4B3F0E1EDBEFB.title: "&fBuild a &6Mine"
	quest.47DCCE7116DEBDCA.quest_desc: ["&n&6Nozzles&r&r can be attached to the front of a Fan to distribute its effects in all directions."]
	quest.4820567302106874.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is completed. It might not seem like much, but you can't have much of a trade empire without a place to store things. "]
	quest.4820567302106874.quest_subtitle: "&7Stores &fitems&7."
	quest.4820567302106874.title: "&fBuild a &6Warehouse"
	quest.48BE7DAC5082044D.quest_desc: ["&n&6The Stressometer&r&r will show you how stressed the system is when you connect it."]
	quest.48D23AFB1260C31F.title: "Talk to Tax Collector"
	quest.494585CCA8720FB2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.494585CCA8720FB2.title: "Craft a &bNetherite Battle Mage"
	quest.49AA58282AF31AB4.quest_desc: [
		"Conductors are perfect for driving Trains. "
		""
		"Right-click an Andesite Casing with a &6Conductor's Cap&r to make one! You can wear them too."
	]
	quest.49AA58282AF31AB4.title: "The Tiniest Conductor"
	quest.4A08A10FE497EADF.quest_subtitle: "&7Kill one of the &fraiders&7."
	quest.4A08A10FE497EADF.title: "&fDefend a &6Raid"
	quest.4A7836DEA6961122.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.4A7836DEA6961122.quest_subtitle: "&7Distributes &fitems&7 to &fworkers huts&7."
	quest.4A7836DEA6961122.title: "&fBuild a &6Courier Hut"
	quest.4A799454B6F6443A.quest_desc: ["Change your fan's processing type more efficiently with Catalysts."]
	quest.4A799454B6F6443A.title: "Little Tippy-Tap Kitty Catalyst"
	quest.4AAA97411115B19C.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.4AAA97411115B19C.quest_subtitle: "Work with your colony."
	quest.4AAA97411115B19C.title: "&fCraft a &6Postbox&f and &6Stash"
	quest.4AB9A1A1223DD0E4.quest_desc: ["A &n&6Mechanical Bearing&r&r rotates attached structures when supplied with Rotational Power."]
	quest.4AD5F58D4CFEB2DF.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Weighted Ejector&r lets you send items through the air. "
		""
		"To select the target location, shift right-click the block where you want the items to land. Then, place the ejector where you want the items to be flung from."
		""
		"You can adjust the weight of the ejector by finding the \"X\" on it. Hold right-click while looking at it, then use the scroll wheel to set the number of items you want the ejector to handle."
	]
	quest.4BC65D4005C17D9F.title: "Craft an&b Electromancer Armor Set"
	quest.4C103FDBC8E175F4.quest_subtitle: "Get money by selling your harvest"
	quest.4C77ABCD41383F32.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Blaze Cake&r is used to Super-Heat the Blaze Burner."]
	quest.4D308AD544372410.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Lightning Spell Power"
	quest.4D308AD544372410.title: "Craft a&b Lightning Upgrade Orb"
	quest.4D94673F7F8A68F7.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.4D94673F7F8A68F7.quest_subtitle: "Houses citizens."
	quest.4D94673F7F8A68F7.title: "&fBuild a &6Residence"
	quest.4D9BE80EC1D1F792.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Smart Chute&r is the same as the Chute but with additional functionalities, such as stack size and filters."]
	quest.4DB0AE85BB0E17A3.quest_subtitle: "Chains together individual Minecarts, causing them to move as a group"
	quest.4DB25D045E392CBD.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.4DB25D045E392CBD.quest_subtitle: "&7Smelts &fstone&7."
	quest.4DB25D045E392CBD.title: "&fBuild a &6Stone Smelter"
	quest.4E54DFDD0B04972E.quest_desc: [
		"This Human seems nice and told me to search for the &6Royal Chef&r,"
		"which should be somewhere here &6inside the Castle&r. "
	]
	quest.4E54DFDD0B04972E.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.4E54DFDD0B04972E.title: "Till The Land"
	quest.4E948759E37C7057.quest_desc: ["Can display text or numbers. This would be useful in making elevators too."]
	quest.4E948759E37C7057.title: "Nixie Tube"
	quest.4E94C9909FE7BE89.quest_desc: ["It is said the ender dragon was cursed to another dimension. Its chains sometimes loosens and it breaks out of its dimension to invade ours. Stand ready to stop this threat where ever he may appear."]
	quest.4E94C9909FE7BE89.title: "Come out to play"
	quest.4EC045B7FABBF0AC.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.4EC045B7FABBF0AC.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts with &fstone&7."
	quest.4EC045B7FABBF0AC.title: "&fBuild a &6Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.4F95F00ED78FBAB9.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6These goggles&r&r will allow you to see your contrations in more detail."
		""
		"It will show things as rotation speed and stress."
	]
	quest.4FCFE2C26FDCA129.quest_subtitle: "Serious defences."
	quest.4FCFE2C26FDCA129.title: "&fHire &68 Guards"
	quest.50418F41EBF35C53.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Spout&r is used to fill items with liquid or poured on certain items. It can be used with a &bdepot&r or a &bbelt&r."]
	quest.505B5C5846D0E711.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Rope Pulley&r can move blocks up or down, they can be glued together."]
	quest.50825590FBA47281.quest_subtitle: "Practical alternative to 'real' trains"
	quest.50A74C04350493E0.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: &4+15% Cooldown Reduction"
	quest.50A74C04350493E0.title: "Obtain a&b Ring of Recovery"
	quest.50F6F5316B5A8A9E.title: "Talk to the Survivors"
	quest.5129EFE45137A390.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.5129EFE45137A390.quest_subtitle: "&7Farms &fwood&7 for your colony."
	quest.5129EFE45137A390.title: "&fBuild a &6Forester's Hut"
	quest.523A6B0EC136A987.quest_subtitle: "Make Players use Recruits"
	quest.525EAE6D0EBA3240.quest_desc: ["Umvuthi the Sunbird is a tribal leader who rules teh Savannah. He has harrassed the locals for far too long, deal with the bird."]
	quest.525EAE6D0EBA3240.title: "Got some Sun in your eye?"
	quest.52E5DCC3089180F3.quest_subtitle: "Sometimes you can't wait, reduce the cool-down. "
	quest.52E5DCC3089180F3.title: "Craft a &bRecovery Rune"
	quest.52FA3A19DE473621.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fglass&7 items."
	quest.52FA3A19DE473621.title: "&fBuild a &6Glassblower's Hut"
	quest.530B24B884622FE8.quest_subtitle: "Place a campfire and a cooking pot on top"
	quest.530B24B884622FE8.title: "We need to cook!"
	quest.532A6227BB194B2A.title: "TP To Arena"
	quest.5369A4AC170D1D7E.quest_desc: ["A repeater that sends a pulse after a configurable amount of time."]
	quest.5391C1240C677127.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Cooldown Reduction"
	quest.5391C1240C677127.title: "Craft a &bCooldown Upgrade Orb"
	quest.53A9F583ED1CFC6E.quest_desc: ["Lets you create your own custom functional clock."]
	quest.53C9B66BEC667ED0.quest_desc: [
		"&bIron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r is a magic mod focused around exploring the world to find magic scrolls in order to cast fantastical magics. "
		""
		"Craft the magic scrolls yourself, or seek out mage towers or deadly crypts around the world and take their loot as your own."
		""
		"You will fight more dangerous mobs like &2Necromancer&r, collect brand new resources, and most importantly: &6Cast Powerful Spells!&r"
	]
	quest.53C9B66BEC667ED0.quest_subtitle: "Magic and stuff..."
	quest.53C9B66BEC667ED0.title: "&bIron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r"
	quest.544A301047565927.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Ender Spell Power"
	quest.544A301047565927.title: "Craft an &bEnder Upgrade Orb"
	quest.547B1BC592ABCBA9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crushing Wheels&r grind items much, much faster than a Millstone, and can grind more items into useful materials. "
		""
		"You can also change their appearance with different Stone types."
	]
	quest.547B1BC592ABCBA9.title: "&lCrushing Wheels"
	quest.55A7089FC773397D.quest_desc: ["&6Brass Gearboxes&r let you toggle this independently for each side."]
	quest.56F1F049F20B29A7.title: "Craft an &bArchevoker Armor Set"
	quest.571CA30C0A4A5DA4.quest_desc: ["The Baker will craft bread dough, cookie dough, cake dough, and raw pumpkin pie, then bake these in a furnace to create bread, cookies, cakes, and pumpkin pies. They will only do this upon request, whether from the Cook, the postbox, or as a minimum stock in the Warehouse."]
	quest.571CA30C0A4A5DA4.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafts &fbaked goods&7 for &fRestaurants&7."
	quest.571CA30C0A4A5DA4.title: "&fBuild a &6Bakery"
	quest.57A7A5C79389A96A.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lWelcome to Create!"
		""
		"This chapter is entirely optional and serves as an introduction to the Create mod, teaching you what it has to offer. "
		""
		"While it doesn't cover every item, it highlights the important things to get you started. "
		""
		"Some items won't be craftable right away, so follow the progression chapters."
		""
		"Each chapter unlocks new content as you progress. Use this chapter as a tutorial and guide. "
		""
		"&a&nThe quest rewards will also help you in the early game.&r&r"
		""
		"&l&nGetting Help&r&r"
		""
		"-> &6Ponder:&r If you have doubts about any blocks or items, hold 'W' to ponder and see an amazing 3D in-game wiki!"
		""
		"-> &6Recipes:&r Hover over an item in an inventory (or in a Quest) and press 'R' to find out how to make it, or press 'U' to find what recipes it's used in."
		""
		"&l&nKey Concepts&r&r"
		""
		"-> &6Stress Units (SU):&r Generators can only supply so much energy, or \"Stress Units,\" to a system of appliances before they're overwhelmed."
		""
		"-> &6Rotational Speed (RPM):&r Things spin at certain speeds, or 'RPM'. Machines use more Stress Units when they're supplied with higher RPMs."
		""
		"-> &6Contraptions:&r Contraptions are builds that can move, either rotationally with Bearings, linearly with Pistons or Gantries, or on rails with Minecarts or Trains. Many appliances are automatically powered when moving on a Contraption."
	]
	quest.57F85C17A350A9FD.title: "Defenders"
	quest.5942EB4298E18A99.quest_subtitle: "Find 5 Poppies, 5 Dandalion and 1 Rose Bush"
	quest.594A8459AD944A3B.quest_desc: [
		"It's hard to keep finding single use scrolls, but by putting the scrolls into a spell book using the inscription table, one can keep using the spell without consuming the scroll."
		""
		"Default key is &6\"x\"&r to open wheel."
		""
		"Default cast key is &6\"r\"&r"
	]
	quest.594A8459AD944A3B.quest_subtitle: "Your first Spellbook"
	quest.594EDA0BA8DFB743.quest_desc: [
		"Can now also be purchased in the Traveling Trader."
		"{@pagebreak}"
	]
	quest.594EDA0BA8DFB743.quest_subtitle: "The Priest mob will trade one for a written book that can be found in the Evoker Fort. The written book must be translated by a captive wandering trader from the Evoker Fort first."
	quest.59A30ACE48CB8F13.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		" The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.59A30ACE48CB8F13.quest_subtitle: "Farms &frabbits&r for your colony."
	quest.59A30ACE48CB8F13.title: "&fBuild a &6Rabbit Hutch"
	quest.59AE879BA13AD91D.quest_desc: ["A redstone component that toggles its state with every redstone pulse."]
	quest.5AB5DF09F2F68283.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Clutch&r will stop any rotation if a redstone signal is applied."]
	quest.5ACBA63440B75895.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Valves&r control the flow of fluids through pipes."
		""
		"Use a Copper Valve Handle to open or close the valve, regulating fluid movement as needed."
		""
		"You can also use rotational power to close or open the valve"
	]
	quest.5AF0D3168EB2AB4C.quest_desc: ["Allows filters"]
	quest.5B36DE3826F26963.quest_desc: [
		"A &n&6Shaft&r is a basic yet crucial machinery part used to transfer rotational power in Create. "
		""
		"It can be extended to connect multiple contraptions that require rotation, without changing the speed of the gears."
	]
	quest.5B7E3FEE27123EE5.quest_desc: ["Ignis is a fire demon of immense power found in the hells of the nether. Slay him to take down one more lord of the nether realm."]
	quest.5B7E3FEE27123EE5.title: "Snuff out the Fire"
	quest.5BF082062143531B.title: "Craft a &bPlagued Armor Set"
	quest.5C38AF82CEFB8015.quest_subtitle: "Rare random world loot."
	quest.5CB2A4E73CD8833F.quest_desc: ["\"Three crowns, united into one. Through alliance, persuasion, or conquest, I have claimed the mantle of Grand Duke. Few ascend to this height, fewer still endure it. From here, the path leads toward kingship, for three Grand Duke crowns may be forged into a King’s Crown. The ink trembles as it writes: I stand at the threshold of sovereignty, yet every step forward draws challengers closer.\""]
	quest.5D284522BCE51032.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: &4+25 Max Mana"
	quest.5D284522BCE51032.title: "Obtain a &bSilver Ring"
	quest.5DB2EA8B85B4EBFC.quest_subtitle: "Acquire 20 seeds"
	quest.5DB2EA8B85B4EBFC.title: "Starting a farm"
	quest.5DDA6BA890AEB544.quest_desc: [
		"Make sure you use the &6cleaver&r to deal the final blow. Otherwise, the mob will not drop its carcass."
		""
		"Later, you can enchant your weapon with the butcher enchantment."
	]
	quest.5DDA6BA890AEB544.quest_subtitle: "Slay 3 pigs with your cleaver"
	quest.5DDA6BA890AEB544.title: "Hunting"
	quest.5DDEA644679784E5.quest_desc: ["It is said this legendary dragon is ancient. It has taken its place in an old watchtower of old that can be found in the world. Slay and free the world of this ancient pest."]
	quest.5DDEA644679784E5.title: "Dracarys No More"
	quest.5EC30214D9EE2A0C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.5EC30214D9EE2A0C.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &anature&r. Increased &anature spell power&r or &aarmor&r."
	quest.5EC30214D9EE2A0C.title: "Craft a&b Nature Rune"
	quest.5F2B96D1C17BA9ED.quest_subtitle: "Harvest a total of 20 wheat and 10 tomatoes"
	quest.5F2B96D1C17BA9ED.title: "Produce"
	quest.5F7FBCB758D54981.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: Grants &bfreezing immunity."
	quest.5F7FBCB758D54981.title: "Obtain a &bFrostward Ring"
	quest.5FB01C4115D0EAA2.quest_desc: ["Buried deep underground this warrior waits for any unlucky traveler to discover him. "]
	quest.5FB01C4115D0EAA2.title: "Executioner's Tomb"
	quest.5FE63709EA0FFA3B.title: "Talk to the Grand Councelor"
	quest.5FF54D91DD9438A3.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train observer&r will look at a specific part of the train track and detect when a train is crossing that specific section of track. It will give out a redstone signal when it detects a train going over that piece of track"
		""
		"The &6train observer&r can also only detect when a specific cargo is being held within the train."
	]
	quest.5FF54D91DD9438A3.quest_subtitle: "Watches for trains"
	quest.6031F721BF5101DA.quest_desc: ["Maybe Scylla was once a daunting pirate with dreams beyond the sea but this realm has a habit of driving its citizens mad. She now rules the ocean she once had dreams of escaping in her temple. Slay her and free the realm of her madness. "]
	quest.6031F721BF5101DA.title: "Storming Winds"
	quest.6073AB1A816E845F.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6073AB1A816E845F.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of &4fire&r. Increased &4fire spell power&r or &4armor&r."
	quest.6073AB1A816E845F.title: "Craft a &bFire Rune"
	quest.61E1F509FC788092.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6Andesite Funnels&r&r Outputs one item at a time from a container but it can input a full stack into a container."
		""
		"Use a Wrench to toggle the Funnel going from Output to Input. You have an arrow on the Funnel that indicates which way the items will go."
		""
		"Funnels can drop items onto the ground, belts, depot, chutes, other funnels, Tunnels or into Portable Storage Interface."
		""
		"You can use a redstone signal on a Funnel to stop it from letting items out or in."
		""
		"&dTip:&r&o &7You can use a Brass Funnel to output a 64x of bread and have a Andesite Funnel input the 64x Bread into a container.&r"
		"&r"
	]
	quest.61E1F509FC788092.title: "Andesite Funnels"
	quest.62534F090B59C3E3.quest_desc: [
		"Make your train yards and junctions pop with our new Semaphore blocks! "
		""
		"They serve the same purpose as nixie tubes, but do so in a far more aesthetically pleasing way."
	]
	quest.62534F090B59C3E3.quest_subtitle: "Controll Moving Trains"
	quest.6265FAB402D76D11.quest_desc: ["The &6millstone&r has the ability to crush many items"]
	quest.6274BD93B411AD44.quest_desc: ["It would seem some withers could be tamed. The Nether is never above a challenged and have upgraded their pet withers to be stronger, faster, and more lethal. Slay this tech monstrosity and prove even with upgrades they are no match for you."]
	quest.6274BD93B411AD44.title: "Wither got an Upgrade"
	quest.63B4347F61566BF9.quest_desc: ["Throw potatos on your friends with this potato cannon."]
	quest.63E05F3657CF988C.quest_desc: ["This lever functions like a precise output power of redstone. You can adjust how much redstone strength you wish to output. "]
	quest.63E05F3657CF988C.title: "Levered Up!"
	quest.6423F47740F77C70.quest_subtitle: "When worn as ring: Grants &2poison immunity."
	quest.6423F47740F77C70.title: "Obtain a &bPoisonward Ring"
	quest.64ABED7932C787DB.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6Portable Interfaces&r&r work in pairs. Place one in the world and another on a moving entity, like a Minecart. When they face each other, they link and transfer items. "
		""
		"They can transfer items on or off moving Contraptions without stopping them, making them very useful for farms."
	]
	quest.654B0D6EAF8E3E75.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fbees&r for your colony."
	quest.654B0D6EAF8E3E75.title: "&fBuild an &6Apiary"
	quest.65868B826E4E908E.quest_desc: [
		"The Flower Shop is where your Florist will grow flowers for your colony, if given compost and an axe. "
		""
		"One important factor to know is that the flower shop has a daily flower limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 4, level 2 has 8. At level 5 it’s daily max is 20. "
		"{image:minecraft:block/cactus_side width:16 height:16}"
		"{image:minecraft:item/sugar_cane width:16 height:16}"
	]
	quest.65868B826E4E908E.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fspecialty crops&r for your colony."
	quest.65868B826E4E908E.title: "&fBuild a &6Plantation"
	quest.66428F3633CBBC85.quest_desc: [
		"&6Train tracks&r are a new type of rails designed specifically for Trains."
		""
		"The Train Tracks are what makes you able to place a Train station, a  bogey to build your train and so on."
		""
		"Train Tracks can interact with Nether Portals, making it possible to go with a Train into the Nether and transport items/lava through a Train Between the Nether and the Overworld."
		""
		"Unfortunately the Nether is the only dimension the Train Tracks interact with."
	]
	quest.66630803C9EA0DEA.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: +5% Holy Spell Power"
	quest.66630803C9EA0DEA.title: "Craft a &bHoly Rune"
	quest.6666B730EB279F11.quest_desc: ["It is said the Kraken hunts it prey in deep oceans. Remove this beast and make the oceans a safer place."]
	quest.6666B730EB279F11.title: "Avenge Jack Sparrow"
	quest.66B982A4B1DC924F.quest_subtitle: "&7Identifies &fAncient Tomes&7."
	quest.66B982A4B1DC924F.title: "&fBuild an &6Enchanter's Tower"
	quest.67300FA6A1228174.quest_desc: ["Even though the Yetis have been imprisioned in ice for eons now, something has changed. The Ice is beginning to melt and if freed they would wreck havoc on all. Find their ice prisons in snow biomes and put an end to them before they are free."]
	quest.67300FA6A1228174.title: "Anyone got Snowcones?"
	quest.687329033DBEB4CC.quest_desc: [
		"The Ancient Tome is a glowing book that’s dropped by raiders during raids. If you have the Ancient Tome in your inventory, it will glow when there is going to be a raid that night. "
		""
		"In the later game, the Enchanter can convert Ancient Tomes into enchanted books. "
	]
	quest.687329033DBEB4CC.quest_subtitle: "&7Foresee a coming &fraid&7."
	quest.687329033DBEB4CC.title: "&fObtain an &6Ancient Tome"
	quest.68CE634580B23789.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the quest-book market. This is where you’ll be earning your money until you’re wealthy enough to start interacting with the general server market."
		""
		"It works on the basis of quests, some ran by the quest book, some by NPCs. Right now you’ll have access to 2 quest stores. This will later be a new tab itself, where more selling options will be available."
	]
	quest.68CE634580B23789.quest_subtitle: "Introduction to the quest-book market"
	quest.691BFA7E3FD5C6BF.title: "Stage 1: Talk to the Wounded Miner"
	quest.69416BCA0EB9380A.quest_desc: ["&6Mechanical Rollers&r help clean up terrain on and under Train Tracks. It can clear blocks in front of it, or can automatically place blocks under Train Tracks from a Train's on-board inventories."]
	quest.69416BCA0EB9380A.title: "Rolling A Fat One"
	quest.6942BE59416AF3B1.quest_desc: ["Placing a carcass on the hanging rope will give you the option to &cdrain it&r. You do that by right clicking it with a &6cleaver&r. Once drained, you can right click it again in order to &charvest it&r."]
	quest.6942BE59416AF3B1.quest_subtitle: "Butcher a carcass and obtain the heart"
	quest.6942BE59416AF3B1.title: "Time to butcher"
	quest.695D86B08337B586.quest_desc: ["An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Helmet. The icon from afar looks like a helmet for a soldier."]
	quest.69DBFE8C98BEAA9C.quest_desc: [
		"Easily change RPM with the &6Rotation Speed Controller&r. "
		""
		"Put a Large Cogwheel in the top, power the Controller and change it to whatever speed you like."
	]
	quest.6A661ECA87029EB9.quest_desc: [
		"&lWho you are:&r A challenger to the throne."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r Claim the right to challenge the &dHigh King &fand attempt to usurp the throne."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lHow to rank up:&r Successfully challenge the &dHigh King &fand prove your dominance."
	]
	quest.6A661ECA87029EB9.title: "&6King"
	quest.6A9AC2D89010ABBE.quest_desc: ["The Bookeeper wants nothing to do with me. Looks like I was buried without a single coin to my name. Not to mention I don't think my currency would even have worked here. Maybe one of these people here in the &6castle library&r can help me?"]
	quest.6A9AC2D89010ABBE.quest_subtitle: "Outsider"
	quest.6A9AC2D89010ABBE.title: "A Word For A Job"
	quest.6AFEDCF1CF22972F.quest_desc: ["Use your newly aquired arcane dust to make yourself some Magicians armor using it and iron armor at a smithing table."]
	quest.6AFEDCF1CF22972F.quest_subtitle: "An early game source of &3additional mana"
	quest.6AFEDCF1CF22972F.title: "Craft a &bWandering Magician"
	quest.6BBEAFA9701FA502.title: "Controller Rail"
	quest.6BEBC6E2E18BE908.title: "Inventor"
	quest.6C258909D42C880E.quest_subtitle: "&7Make your colonists &fhappy&7."
	quest.6C258909D42C880E.title: "&fBuild a &6Mystical Site"
	quest.6C63B932DB2BC31D.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Sequence Gearshift&r&r allows you to set up a sequence of rotations that are executed when the block receives a redstone signal."]
	quest.6C90039BB1651603.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Holy Spell Power"
	quest.6C90039BB1651603.title: "Craft a &bHoly Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6D74E5F0C020FD0B.quest_desc: [
		"The Barracks is the ultimate protection for your colony. The Barracks Towers (unlike the normal Guard tower) will employ and house one Guard for every level built, for a total of 5 Guards per Barracks Tower!"
		""
		"In the later game you will likely want two barracks chock full of &mexpendable&r brave souls."
		""
		"Tip: At level 3, you can hire spies for 5 gold per raid, these spies will go out into the world and if barbarians are spotted, the spies will tell you exactly where the barbarians are."
	]
	quest.6D74E5F0C020FD0B.quest_subtitle: "&7Strengthen your &fdefences&7."
	quest.6D74E5F0C020FD0B.title: "&fBuild a &6Barracks"
	quest.6D75E038AE21C2E5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6fluid tank&r is a easy way to store a large amount of liquid. "
		""
		"The biggest it can be is a 3x3 base and upto 30 tall, which stores a crazy amount"
	]
	quest.6E2B46D5F2596E20.quest_desc: ["By right cliking on the ground, you can summon in a \"mirror\" that will, well, mirror the blocks you place down."]
	quest.6E8031A380EB37C8.quest_desc: [
		"You may quickly notice as your explore your world that you will be finding scrolls. "
		""
		"Each scroll contains a spell, similar to an enchanted book. "
		""
		"The scroll can be consumed to cast that spell without consuming mana or triggering a cooldown, or brought to the first new workstation added: the Inscription Table."
		""
		"At the inscription table, you are allowed to place a spell book, one either found or crafted, and slot the scroll into it."
		""
		"However, depending on the rarity of the scroll (determined by the spell’s level), it may be too powerful for your spell book."
		""
		"In this case, you need a better spell book."
	]
	quest.6E8031A380EB37C8.quest_subtitle: "Inscribing spells"
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Once you have found the location for your colony, you will likely want to build either a supply camp or supply ship. You can choose one but not both. Either will provide you with some basic supplies to help you get started in the early game. &o&7(bed, food, basic tools and armor, starting resources, etc.)&r&r It’s beneficial to place your supply camp or ship near your colony as you will be traveling back and forth to it frequently in the early game. &eClose, but not in the way close.&r"]
	quest.6F63D33FEF64B526.quest_desc: [
		"&lWho you are:&r \"The crown rests upon me, heavier than steel. I am Duke, chosen by the will of greater lords. My dominion stretches wide, my voice echoes through the courts of Arkain. With this title comes power to sway kingdoms, to decide who shall rise and who shall fall. My crown is more than ornament — it is a symbol of dominion, and with others it may forge a greater destiny.\""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r Help decide the fate of the realm, including choosing the ruling power."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&nSpecial ability:&r Three &3Counts &fcan pool resources to purchase a special item that promotes one &3Count &fto &6King&f."
		""
		"&o&4Warning:&r This item can only be purchased &nonce&r per &3Count&f; if lost, you can no longer vote for a &6King&f.&r"
	]
	quest.6F63D33FEF64B526.title: "&3Duke"
	quest.6FB5BB638FCCE5A6.quest_desc: [
		"&n&6The Backtank&r&r stores pressurized air, providing oxygen for underwater breathing with a diving helmet. "
		""
		"It can be powered by rotation to collect pressurized air, which is also used by equipment like Extendo Grips, Potato Cannons, and Diving Helmets."
	]
	quest.70441032159A90E6.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&6Radial Chassis&r can be used similar to the &3Super Glue&r. It will connect blocks in a line, on the sides, without the need for glue."
		""
		"The &n&6Linear Chassis&r can be used similar to the &3Super Glue&r. It will connect blocks in a line without the need for glue."
	]
	quest.70441032159A90E6.title: "Chassis"
	quest.704435187B4BD245.quest_desc: ["Runestones are a more rare find in magical structures, and are always found as blank runestones. Using 8 focuses, you can craft a runestone to a specific school, and use your inscribed runestone to craft gear related to that school."]
	quest.704435187B4BD245.title: "Obtain a &bBlank Runestone"
	quest.7124FD269AE128F1.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &6Steam Whistle&r and combine with your train and activate it. "
		""
		"While driving the train, use the sprint key to blow the whistle. The Whistle's pitch will be accounted for. Non-player conductors will also blow the whistles shortly before arriving at distant stations."
		""
		"Note: &oIf multiple whistles are on a Train, a player can only blow the Whistle at the frontmost of the Train. NPC Conductors can play every Whistle, however.&r"
	]
	quest.718533DAD98B751E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Brass Tunnel&r is an upgraded version of the Andesite Tunnel. The Brass Tunnel has filter slots and some control options."
		""
		"Like the Andesite variant, if you place a belt connecting from its side, it will split items as well but you can use the filters slots to specify which item goes where. "
		""
		"Each filter slot is independent of each other so you can have one item go one way and the other go the other way. "
		""
		"You can also configure the distribution mode to make a 64x stack to be split into 32x stack."
		""
		"When placed in a row on parallel belts, the Brass Tunnels will form a group and incoming items can be distributed to your preferable configurations through the filters or distribution mod."
	]
	quest.718533DAD98B751E.title: "Brass Tunnels"
	quest.7259701778971E87.quest_desc: ["Same as the Andesite Track Switch but also allows for switching for scheduled trains."]
	quest.727087FEAF9EFB98.title: "How to: PvP"
	quest.72A486BDBBF49659.quest_subtitle: "&7Brews &fpotions&7."
	quest.72A486BDBBF49659.title: "&fBuild a &6Alchemist Tower"
	quest.72CCC3706ED918F0.quest_desc: ["An upgraded version of the Copper Backtank. How is there so much defense if you're not protected from the front, though?"]
	quest.72ED3D8177DBADBB.quest_subtitle: "When around neck: &4+15% Mana Regeneration"
	quest.7301EFF239786128.title: "Kill the Pillagers"
	quest.731475AD1C17E962.quest_desc: [
		"The resource scroll is an easy way to tell what one of your Builder needs. Sneak + right-click on a Builder’s Hut to register the resource scroll to the builder."
		""
		"Now when you right-click while holding the resource scroll, you will see all the needed materials for the Builder’s Hut you clicked on."
	]
	quest.731475AD1C17E962.quest_subtitle: "Find out what your builder needs."
	quest.731475AD1C17E962.title: "&fCraft a &6Resource Scroll"
	quest.731B98240641F30F.quest_desc: ["Summon this hellish creature and prove you are the better fighter. Once slain use its star to make a beacon and place it to show all you are better."]
	quest.731B98240641F30F.title: "Wither Storm Baby"
	quest.73C40602E25560E8.quest_desc: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
	quest.73C40602E25560E8.quest_subtitle: "&7Crushes &fmaterials&7."
	quest.73C40602E25560E8.title: "&fBuild a &6Crusher"
	quest.74370B84A072E947.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Arcane Anvil&r allows you to place 2 scrolls of the same type/level and combine them into the next level up. "
		""
		"By placing a weapon and a spell scroll into th &6Arcane Anvil&r you can also imbue the effects of the used scroll into said weapon (consumes scroll,) making the weapon able to cast the spell. "
		""
		"A &eShriving Stone&r can be used to take off an imbued spell from a weapon."
	]
	quest.74370B84A072E947.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading and Imbuement"
	quest.74C07D4EB93A7882.quest_desc: [
		"Using Tinkerer's Construct you've made yourself some stone tools, good job!"
		""
		"Next, you'll be given an option of two paths to follow. &aAgriculture&r or &6Butchery&r. "
		""
		"Butchery will give you more money, but is harder. Farming, while a little longer, is easier!"
	]
	quest.74C07D4EB93A7882.quest_subtitle: "What's next"
	quest.753B48CB539ACA4E.quest_desc: ["&n&6Fluid Pipes&r&r transfer fluid through them. Right-click with a Wrench to add a window and watch the fluids move!"]
	quest.753B48CB539ACA4E.title: "Fluid Pipe"
	quest.756394031B1088DF.quest_desc: [
		"A more advanced Funnel that allows for filtering items and to output a specific amount of items up to a full stack at a time."
		""
		"&dTip:&r &o&7You can use a Brass Funnel to output a 64x of bread and have a Andesite Funnel input the 64x Bread into a container.&r&r"
	]
	quest.756394031B1088DF.title: "Brass Funnels"
	quest.75709A3CC301B8A4.quest_desc: [
		"Ink can be found in magic structures, such as wizard towers, and is the key to crafting scrolls. "
		""
		"There are 5 variants, one for each rarity of scroll."
		""
		"When using &6ink&r in the&6 Scroll Forge&r, it will allow you to craft a spell of the corresponding rarity, at the lowest level available. If the minimum rarity of a spell is higher than the ink provided, you will not be able to craft it at all, instead needing a higher quality ink to craft its first level."
	]
	quest.75709A3CC301B8A4.quest_subtitle: "Ink can be automated using create mod."
	quest.75813E7A5E88D3B8.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Spell Resistance"
	quest.75813E7A5E88D3B8.title: "Craft a&b Protection Upgrade Orb"
	quest.75F687DA453DE95E.quest_desc: [
		"&eThe book-keeper will sell you citizenship for 100 coins.&r"
		""
		"Finish the Outsider questline and turn in the money in order to proceed to the next rank!"
	]
	quest.75F687DA453DE95E.quest_subtitle: "The next rank - Artisan"
	quest.770A23791D7F7DB6.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Mixer&r can be used combined with the Basin to craft."]
	quest.77B73037DFEF81A8.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.77B73037DFEF81A8.quest_subtitle: "Research new technologies."
	quest.77B73037DFEF81A8.title: "&fBuild a &6University"
	quest.77F35241DE94A6E7.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.77F35241DE94A6E7.quest_subtitle: "Used to summon your &fguards&7."
	quest.77F35241DE94A6E7.title: "&fCraft a &6Rallying Banner"
	quest.79C542CA156AB01E.quest_desc: [
		"In the Create mod,&6 &lkinetic energy&r&r is the power generated by moving parts. "
		""
		"This energy is used to run various machines and contraptions."
		""
		"You can generate kinetic energy using devices like Water Wheels, Windmills etc. "
		""
		"Once generated, this energy can be transferred through shafts, gears, and other mechanical components to operate your creations."
	]
	quest.79C542CA156AB01E.title: "Generate Energy"
	quest.7A154BE7095012ED.quest_desc: [
		"A &n&6Gearbox&r&r is used to change the direction of rotation for shafts. "
		""
		"It can have multiple shafts attached on different sides"
	]
	quest.7A154BE7095012ED.title: "&lGearbox"
	quest.7A4EBBDF610BE57B.quest_desc: [
		"\"The graveyard mist clung to me as I rose from the earth, nameless and unseen. The people of Arkain look upon me with suspicion, for I am Warborn — my mind shackled, my magic bound. Until I prove myself worthy of citizenship, I remain powerless, a wanderer at the edge of society. The path forward is clear: seek recognition, or remain forever an outsider.\""
		"Freshly spawned players."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lWhat you can do:&r "
		"Limited access to mods and features to ensure you learn the rules and help protect the server."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lHow to rank up:&r "
		"Complete a series of quests to become a &2Freeloader&f."
	]
	quest.7A4EBBDF610BE57B.quest_subtitle: "Risen, but unknown to all"
	quest.7A4EBBDF610BE57B.title: "Outsider"
	quest.7A7D302E0EFDC7CF.quest_desc: [
		"&6&nMechanical Pumps&r&r move fluid into pipes in a specific direction when powered."
		""
		"The Mechanical Pump can move liquid by 16 tubes away, it’s not affected by RPM/speed. Speeding the rotation of the Mechanical Pump does make the liquid move faster."
		""
		"Use a Wrench to change the pump's direction."
	]
	quest.7CC964188E01B5AA.title: "How to: War and Recruits"
	quest.7D16C3384BECDCDD.title: "RANK: Artisan"
	quest.7D451281BC78C87C.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.7D451281BC78C87C.quest_subtitle: "&7Train your &fguards&7 to become &fknights&7."
	quest.7D451281BC78C87C.title: "&fBuild a &6Combat Academy"
	quest.7D67058592EE5958.quest_desc: ["The &n&6Schematicannon&r&r will build the structures from Schematics, taking materials from nearby chests and using gunpowder as fuel."]
	quest.7E0C052D94C0C36C.quest_desc: [
		"The Chicken Farmer’s Hut is where the Chicken Farmer will raise chickens, collect eggs, and butcher chickens for food. You will have to capture and bring in two chickens to the Chicken Farmer’s Hut, as the Chicken Farmer will not catch and bring in any chickens."
		""
		"The Chicken Farmer will only keep two chickens alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten chickens."
	]
	quest.7E0C052D94C0C36C.quest_subtitle: "Farms &fchickens&r for your colony."
	quest.7E0C052D94C0C36C.title: "&fBuild a &6Chicken Farmer's Hut"
	quest.7E33E5C1280D3DC2.quest_desc: ["Remember in the beginning how it seemed that everyone was sick with Influenza and you had to keep feeding everyone carrots and potatoes? With the hospital built, they can go see the doctor and get cured by the Healer. You or the colony still needs to supply the ingredients."]
	quest.7E33E5C1280D3DC2.quest_subtitle: "Treat the sick."
	quest.7E33E5C1280D3DC2.title: "&fBuild a &6Hospital"
	quest.7E4215B970A84153.quest_desc: [
		"These&6 pattern schematics&r can be used to extend existing designs, such as lengthening a bridge by repeating its schematic. Simply load them into a schematicannon to start building!"
		""
		"&6Pattern Schematics&r can also be placed on trains, gantry carriages, or any other contraptions to infinitely replicate the schematic. Schematics mounted on deployers will continuously repeat their structure."
	]
	quest.7E4514EE0B2E0D52.quest_desc: [
		"The Composter’s Hut is where the Composter will turn organic materials into compost, which can be used by the Farmer or Florist to fertilize crops or flowers. "
		""
		"Note: You must configure the composter’s hut with the items you want composted before the composter will compost. &7&oThis sounds similar to a woodchuck tongue twister.&r"
	]
	quest.7E4514EE0B2E0D52.quest_subtitle: "Converts organic waste to &ffertilizer&r."
	quest.7E4514EE0B2E0D52.title: "&fBuild a &6Composter's Hut"
	quest.7E6E43008E840EE7.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.7E6E43008E840EE7.quest_subtitle: "Houses 4 colonists."
	quest.7E6E43008E840EE7.title: "&fBuild a &6Tavern"
	quest.7EF4A265C25EFF12.quest_subtitle: "When used for Upgrade: &4+5% Ice Spell Power"
	quest.7EF4A265C25EFF12.title: "Craft an &bIce Upgrade Orb"
	quest.7F1A89396E466A62.quest_desc: ["A helmet that lets you use air from an equipped tank to breathe underwater. "]
	quest.7F528EB8884937D0.quest_subtitle: "Creeper? Awww, man"
	quest.7F68214ADED83FCC.quest_subtitle: "Cutting raw beef on a cutting board"
	quest.7FB1C0D520B7B4FC.quest_desc: ["The dead king is elusive and in hiding. Find his hidden spot before he amasses an undead army to march onto the world."]
	quest.7FB1C0D520B7B4FC.title: "What is dead, may die again"
